 Recovery itself is therefore a controlled plan.
 
+For a consequential corrective transition, the controlled ordering is:
+
+Authorization → Execution → Observation → Evidence → Verification
+→ VerificationReceipt → Exact-parent applicability check
+→ World Kernel CAS atomic commit → Post-commit successful outcome delivery.
+
+Recovery execution alone is not recovery success. VerificationReceipt is a
+pre-commit artifact and is not a WORLD_COMMIT_RECEIPT. Only a successful World
+Kernel boundary may commit modeled World State.
