+Verification informs a corrective candidate; it does not itself commit modeled
+World State. The Recovery Engine coordinates the attempt, while only the World
+Kernel performs the exact-parent CAS atomic commit and post-commit outcome
+delivery. Recovery evidence preserves external and historical truth without
